Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Comparison of the results", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"6cecd992-1815-4dbc-b53d-3fedd2636e86"],

Cell["\<\
For the comparison of the results, we need to use the mapping between the \
SILH operator set and the Warsaw basis derived before.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f217133b-c7ba-4d3d-8f77-bc9d2613d344"],

Cell["\<\
For every coefficient we compute the difference of our results and the ones \
obtained in https://arxiv.org/abs/1512.03003, with the appropriate \
corrections following https://arxiv.org/abs/1509.05942v2.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c37b13be-c486-4bde-8a1b-a21f7bcddf36"],

Cell["\<\
In the next section, we will then show the origin of these discrepancies.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"97643686-8ac8-487e-b3aa-4138ca391c2a"],

